# Call priority: Pon beats Chi; red-five pon variants (05m vs 55m) are distinct legal actions.
# After Seat 2 pons 5m using 05m, Seat 2 discards 7s and Seat 3 rons.
# Scoring for Seat 3 (non-dealer, West):
#   Hand: 234m 678m 234p 56s 88p + ron 7s (ryanmen wait 4s/7s, non-yakuhai pair 88p)
#   Yaku: pinfu (1) + tanyao (1) = 2 han. Dora indicator 1z -> dora 2z (0 dora).
#   Fu: 20 base + 10 menzen ron = 30 fu.
#   Non-dealer ron 2 han 30 fu = 2000 from Seat 2.

[meta]
